2026-07-27T09:17:27.7224628Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:17:27.7225204Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:17:27.7226083Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
